#: scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6fdbc69464cd4fb6959bed9deb09e9cb954c886de5fba34361f04bbb23dfdaa
#. default-sha256: 9f745ab403f95fd577c018461798cebce3605bef1aa7f887af1ed75764aa105c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Despite his near devastation by Nellie’s news, "
"Mell’s flaxen eyes continued to wander in hopes of catching sight of the girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ce que lui avait dit Nellie avait beau le "
"plonger dans un profond désespoir, il continua malgré tout à promener ses yeux noisette partout "
"dans l’espoir d’apercevoir la jeune fille."

#: scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55d233ea54c88a6f5482cba1d096b2c09e5ee28a7186c5c85baaff1e42a8700b
#. default-sha256: db2a2e4ee0a474febc202a38910df3f5ba90db4069c77e0c0b75447a3a0fccda
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. By now, it should be quite obvious to you what Mell was feeling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Héhéhé.  ⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ présent, vous devez avoir compris ce que Mell ressentait pour elle."

#: scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 092676d6f4c5d38caab8fa7dba4d9f87f37e2fbcbe72c8b0883cb4e76a09f294
#. default-sha256: a6d570e63879136c2b42f96f9760376f59a5e1b2b47b1345e87c296379db4f2a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the boy himself was having difficulty comprehending the things going through his heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais le garçon lui-même avait du mal à comprendre ce qu’il se passait dans son cœur."

#: scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fcbbde59d7bc2549774e117c8863fdc526f67bee774cb79755bda54c2f73e6a
#. default-sha256: f45693e77494af9f9915f33f27a3c330de76389dfd585194cf82311d8430f67f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Emotionally, he was horribly unstable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like a ship without a sail."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫É⟪k:2⟫motionnellement, il était terriblement instable –⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ comme un navire sans "
"voile."

#: scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 389a8b8fca119719bc1ecf7ec49c0a69ef18cf15f52529ca8c2ea91a2750c392
#. default-sha256: 42e1e20e27b19806592fc9d6862082f96708338e850019d981146016a39e8d9a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And still, every time he spotted the White-Haired Girl, his heart would leap, his whole body "
"jitter with anxiety and excitement."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et dès qu’il apercevait la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs, son cœur bondissait, tout son corps "
"tremblait d’anxiété et d’excitation."

#: scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4acdeb09da8592fe94fcd4dfa76d9928bbb4b2c7f41c2a26781ab9fc42e6222d
#. default-sha256: 4c8b206fad46898a15dbd5da99c2f09c04b2628473569e15a117c49b415702d4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never felt anything like this before, and as such, he struggled to keep these strange "
"emotions in check."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était la première fois qu’il ressentait cela et il avait donc de la peine à maîtriser ses "
"émotions."

#: scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0465a2235357fb9b85b571d6cb13fe59ff2b3bbd92eb6287aeb3fa38dbaf18c
#. default-sha256: 22ce3b7f5fc35cc3d135063d1539f1b11e5f00b12ee9f3979fe815049ff323d7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever he saw an opportunity, Mell would speak to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dès qu’il en avait l’opportunité, Mell parlait à la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a23b3c8708affdd4c2e556ec13abfca02cc413b3bdc0957132cbfa05655a64d7
#. default-sha256: 0847f51305205e4175968e98483ee7063e8e3ddaa5fc17b193cdf303b24e82c8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And days he was unable to, he either spent in secluded silence or a distracted daze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et les jours où il ne pouvait le faire, il se retranchait dans un profond silence, le regard "
"vague."

#: scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c7ea1084c0748c023664266bf6ad26aea5caa22d8e7a45665f4de796ab65175
#. default-sha256: 8bea38011f09d645f57a3feaa3ce59e3789e9383d8bbd98dbe439f014e34c85d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Love is a curious thing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It has the power to change those who experience it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’amour est une chose curieuse.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il a le pouvoir de changer ceux qui en font "
"l’expérience."

#: scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c2d4b5cbd26f238f5a71accfd33bec48fff34525312aede154e0676600dc132
#. default-sha256: 32aa842d439871bc53d0310677814dcb9b3834f7520f954322a3bc06ca10de37
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When he did manage to approach her, he tripped over his tongue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Again and again he "
"talked to her, and again and again he stumbled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lorsqu’il réussissait à l’approcher, il balbutiait.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il avait beau lui parler encore "
"et encore, il bredouillait encore et encore."

#: scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48a8b7a98e4e0cd548530d96dd34f97244bd6f0a23d5ab9cc5c87094b7a5b263
#. default-sha256: d2965084310e5efc56fd9e0d03629d280c4b8ef63e0db86ad26de387449c2e5b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine, if you were to take him to see a romance at the theatre in his present state, he "
"would cry just as much as little Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je pense que, si on l’avait à ce moment-là emmené au théâtre voir un drame romantique, il "
"aurait pleuré tout autant que la petite Nellie."

#: scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cbfbd061b3e06cb412ce5cc071746c70ea352a0f4ad63bb6678a78e30b19bbf
#. default-sha256: 6b30a8d83e1a9da65c7631fce743bb9a9be414e4644dfd043f379dc11c1aee6a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We cry at tragedies because we draw parallels with our own lives.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At least, that is "
"what I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nous pleurons en voyant des tragédies parce que nous traçons des parallèles avec notre "
"propre vie.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Du moins, c’est mon avis."

#: scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f1e4c4fcbce1d13336bed1ea2cfa314be9b5cc0465b341b37b0c9850ad93cc8
#. default-sha256: 312008ea48a036f59c75c4382cbdc1ca2ac0bccb17f129b02cefff3bd646e946
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Great tales of romance attain true gravity with the audience only when they are personally "
"familiar with love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les grandes histoires d’amour n’atteignent vraiment les gens que lorsqu’ils savent eux-mêmes "
"ce qu’est l’amour."

#: scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5368ddfd50289418d8743c2b6fc7035d03de76231f50c3a1904fd1e1384fbe0
#. default-sha256: 7f39cdbf9440c3a6b402c65b4e53b6e28c7b056fd9ac44e44052ce008bc1dcd7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In any event, the White-Haired Girl was, as a result of this, visibly perturbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫En tout cas, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs semblait, suite à cela, visiblement déroutée."

#: scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 505460252fa5e823cd141617a9170d85034f457c6369992c546967045aaedf63
#. default-sha256: 7f506fbd17260378b1cf6eca9dda5172153f241f223523d3916b9cc56c09f5ba
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was delighted that he was being so kind to her, but confusion overpowered every other "
"emotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle était très contente qu’il soit aussi gentil avec elle mais la perplexité l’emportait."

#: scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ff83a396ef914a44f64ec17281dd83bed4666d16bf0941e9a1339b90e7eede0
#. default-sha256: 90ca965d7dcae458c86e83bcc4d9ce45f3b519055a43e4df2b00b90e78dbe59a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be at a loss for what to do as he clumsily catapulted words and stares at "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle avait l’air de ne pas savoir quoi faire quand il la bombardait maladroitement de "
"paroles et qu’il la fixait intensément."

#: scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18862edf937c31b74428e66223949b1b86699a97321c80290af164e801ce2104
#. default-sha256: a3d8974086727b855615c8f651cd441f20a66107b14d647d9e0e140136a05385
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Mell did not back down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though he probably knew not what ⟪k:3⟫caused⟪k:4⟫ such "
"fiery emotion to erupt from within his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais Mell ne s’avoua pas vaincu —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫même s’il devait se douter de la vraie ⟪k:3⟫"
"nature⟪k:4⟫ de ses émotions."

#: scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb15c4acf3e405cdbed10d1bcb087fab252937ed5cf3ed0f1c62e5587436de53
#. default-sha256: 5cc3388831666f6cc64799eb62bd6bdd49189c84fcf66084c90fd9e92954e8eb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One’s first love, in particular, tends to burn like a wildfire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you familiar "
"with the sensation, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le premier amour, tout particulièrement, a tendance à tout brûler et ravager sur son passage."
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Connaissez-vous cette sensation, Maître ?"

#: scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B
