msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5CBE2DE6_446B_4749_B4EA_A3A5775DE1F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the girl did not like the outside world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There were lots of scary things "
"out there, after all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cependant, la fille n’aimait pas le monde extérieur.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il y avait trop de choses qui "
"lui faisaient peur dehors, après tout."

#: scenario:scenario_968DE948_AA2E_4701_A939_A2785F7CEE19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b1cadbda0ee2c1dd3a3ea014694957e9d43b6ded29174d505f859c17363812d
