#: scenario:scenario_5DD066D5_F911_4923_8D23_5AFFFF403A43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8af1ac92dd84ac799524aa1035848a7291a37f826a7f16fab4f3333240c7225
