msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3ABF5463_D001_4F4A_A6C9_1C2026CFA592"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By then, she had already forgotten why she was locked up.⟪k:1⟫But she was content with the "
"darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle avait alors oublié pourquoi elle était emprisonnée.⟪k:1⟫Mais elle était contente de son "
"sort et se satisfaisait de l’obscurité."

#: scenario:scenario_75F3E623_5F82_40D5_9D38_FBAA6F03E566
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86e0911e299603a980c070b1a6e4b4d7a6b9f8e973b8d03404e29ce409fd838f
#. default-sha256: 4a2787d492990674d944dda013a17a8df56c37c20fd08ef4f6922c518f04b04b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75F3E623_5F82_40D5_9D38_FBAA6F03E566"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, her eyes couldn’t help but be drawn to the little bit of light that spilled through "
"the one window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cependant, ses yeux ne manquaient pas d’être attirés par le petit rai de lumière qui émanait "
"de la fenêtre."

#: scenario:scenario_A1CE68A2_61F6_4F65_ABFC_0CB2CA4A3E84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66301a95ec7f07f2d1a857539dde901b8eef27b8e00fa4e7f6077290518b6a74
