msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A1CE68A2_61F6_4F65_ABFC_0CB2CA4A3E84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though she was comfortable in the darkness, the sight of the light made her heart race."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle avait beau se sentir bien dans l’obscurité, son cœur palpitait dès qu’elle voyait de la "
"lumière."

#: scenario:scenario_C81E3409_A993_4D5C_9C3D_6A9C97AD8171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed01d5a845c21addbe7f8eeae6c6e27bd6bbe0d2ca424823e2aa66dbf949dca8
#. default-sha256: d8269c48ee950e14828c65438fe4affa80d4c45454cc9541a91a5c03812cd8bb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C81E3409_A993_4D5C_9C3D_6A9C97AD8171"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first, the girl thought it was because she found it unpleasant.⟪k:1⟫Because she disliked "
"the light, and the outside.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But slowly she came to realize..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au début, la fille pensa que c’était parce que cela la dérangeait.⟪k:1⟫Parce qu’elle "
"n’aimait pas la lumière, ni le monde au dehors.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mais peu à peu, elle se rendit compte..."

#: scenario:scenario_7C3F21D2_96F0_4230_AECB_D134EDD86581
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd94111aae0614a76d9eca215fc2ee44778d677903f8ed60b94fdedce85c0f05
#. default-sha256: 9dd62f0c3f1cb1386c042143cc813652ce2598fb650e58c7f4dbde80f43d30c7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7C3F21D2_96F0_4230_AECB_D134EDD86581"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that she was curious about the outside world."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫qu’elle était curieuse de ce qu’il pouvait y avoir à l’extérieur."

#: scenario:scenario_0BDEAF15_C627_4CAD_B87A_AAEA6E7F867C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ff2235ac735d8090d78d042742e4c8071b822d77d23d550fdeda0a8d29b3a26
