msgid "⟪k:0⟫So the girl decided to write letters and throw them out the window."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est pourquoi la fille décida d’écrire des lettres et de les lancer par la fenêtre."

#: scenario:scenario_AF0547E0_2202_43F4_8CB8_701330F35362
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d51651d3c73b35d17737bd9c099921a34bef261226f5ddcaa6bd38ff1a742cb
#. default-sha256: dc9dca8f0a5fd6724c656194112a4653ef911efc0c445c8a1f43ffe8fb562a55
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AF0547E0_2202_43F4_8CB8_701330F35362"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What began as empty grasping became routine, continuing for several months until she was "
"finally ready to give up. ⟪k:1⟫But then, a beautiful white dove flew in through the window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce qui commença comme un simple divertissement devint une vraie routine et elle continua "
"ainsi durant plusieurs mois, et ce jusqu’à ce qu’elle soit sur le point de renoncer. ⟪k:1⟫C’est "
"alors qu’une belle colombe traversa la fenêtre et vola jusqu’à elle."

#: scenario:scenario_B47548E6_0E8F_4E36_9FDC_DE0C47D1DEBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ab76e5659cf02f72a091ce1ec27ffe582d5a8eadae6152d5879cb77ca52ca7e
#. default-sha256: e768c962a87e53db56e98f97b3ca18db8f59d0f0269c780ba180c5c2dc7d49f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B47548E6_0E8F_4E36_9FDC_DE0C47D1DEBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tied to the dove’s leg was a letter.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Her heart racing, she read "
"the words contained within.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It seemed to have been written by a man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il y avait, attachée à la patte de la colombe, une lettre.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Son "
"cœur battait à tout rompre lorsqu’elle en lut le contenu.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Elle semblait avoir été écrite "
"par un homme."

#: scenario:scenario_5D40A3C0_D6F8_4C03_845D_28CA0562CDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c229fe3ee9742f3517de96c31adb7d38973107316b6b0f9646e22cc62187721
#. default-sha256: 98efd1a5374b3b99893f78fa28a811b61fe888830440a558830bf70bcc7f57f2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D40A3C0_D6F8_4C03_845D_28CA0562CDA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The letter contained numerous questions for the girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It also said that if she "
"attached her reply to the dove, it would bring the letter back to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La lettre contenait de nombreuses questions destinées à la fille.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle disait aussi "
"que si elle attachait sa réponse à la patte de la colombe, cette dernière lui rapporterait la "
"lettre."

#: scenario:scenario_88A1B4A4_544C_4C3D_9D98_E4A5630AB3FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a7f787263a8150a5c824fdabaeab5d6c30363f6bac08db3e5641c5a6fa09d4f
#. default-sha256: f0039e3fad2beffef3f40aded9fdf0f194be8fdce02e75e1a554f0dc42eadaa5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88A1B4A4_544C_4C3D_9D98_E4A5630AB3FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was astonished, but she wrote him back anyway, taking care not to mention where she was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle était stupéfaite mais elle lui répondit quand même, en faisant bien attention à ne pas "
"mentionner où elle se trouvait."

#: scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2075bc2cb3c474ae663378b59b9db4eeaecff2ef369eb50c793aa18922e0af83
#. default-sha256: 1d66534ba7cc4d94b278f70c7a1f5d568862129571d88377a9397ebe0b896924
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After having exchanged letters a number of times, the two felt very close to one another—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as though they had known each other for many years, despite having never met."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Après avoir échangé un certain nombre de lettres, les deux se sentirent plus proches—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫ comme s’ils s’étaient connus depuis de longues années, alors même qu’ils ne s’étaient "
"jamais vus."

#: scenario:scenario_E1D084C7_359D_451B_BB8F_83B19A632203
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b94cfb76acef4641dec880c979de2f9ca58849d6c13344a499a72c4a4580a900
