msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CF942B2A_8573_4AC4_8405_038F9ECDAAF3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl was unsure what to do.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Should she tell him of how she lived?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Should she reveal where she spent her days?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La fille n’était pas certaine de savoir quoi faire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Devait-elle lui dire comment "
"elle vivait ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Devait-elle révéler où elle passait ses journées ?"

#: scenario:scenario_F39C6EB2_6A99_4340_8145_03CBE6A4C640
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 309d986149e7f89f3dfb2389536dd6d4e3c50f9085bf21a6c230222f22781210
