msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you think she did?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Que décida-t-elle, à votre avis ?"

#: scenario:scenario_6BA85D26_61EC_4840_A811_4DC4ABA3B256
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddd26acfb975c44d878d67f5d345fb5057d45f2b045fb48e42c7fd073fd0b089
