msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wrote a letter and agreed to meet him, right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle écrit une lettre et accepta de le rencontrer, non ?"

#: scenario:scenario_FE34D9F5_4D42_4880_AD4E_25D719C40481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
