msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The sealed door had been opened, and in the doorway stood a handsome "
"young man. ⟪k:5⟫“I have come for you,” he said."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La porte scellée avait été ouverte et sur le seuil se tenait un beau "
"jeune homme. ⟪k:5⟫« Je suis venu vous chercher », dit-il."

#: scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e178c29c5511ffe6c39e63dd18d1fcfa3262ab00b4c2de09e519212f070fa3a
#. default-sha256: 13ebd2f28a6e410f50e77d2e672ebcdf95d212bab2e2c7d5d98ff0e69a8805e5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587D24C8_0F1A_4CA3_BEEE_FA016552CD02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man was a prince from a neighboring kingdom. ⟪k:1⟫When the girl stepped outside, before "
"her sat a magnificent carriage—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the likes of which she had never before seen—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"accompanied by many servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’homme était un prince d’un royaume voisin. ⟪k:1⟫Quand la fille mit un pas dehors, elle vit "
"devant elle un magnifique carrosse —⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ elle n’en avait jamais vu de semblable —⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ "
"entouré de nombreux serviteurs."

#: scenario:scenario_85008DAE_7D90_4D84_B7E9_08E84D3F21A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e10c9e7437ea6210f4c738c08f2315e1c20a56b028e0fd968381f46e6892865b
