#: scenario:scenario_429C3B75_9295_4AF5_9F6A_262D3D40401D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 894e406ee666627ac05917dbfaf88cf0bbd0e6fabe0703c9e84c1e73b4d6b308
