"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You think so? Nellie still fantasizes about her prince, and she’s fourteen. ⟪k:2⟫I just "
"assumed all girls were the same."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous pensez ? Nellie continue à fantasmer sur son prince, et elle a quatorze ans. ⟪k:2⟫"
